# Constitution

Non-negotiables for every Playwright task in this repo. Detail lives in `playwright-conventions.mdc` and `qa-orchestration.mdc`.

## MUST

| Rule | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| Role-based locators | Prefer `getByRole` (then label / placeholder / text / test id). Locators live in `pages/`, never inline in specs. |
| Web-first assertions | Assert with Playwright `expect` on locators/responses — no fixed sleeps. |
| `storageState` auth | Authenticated projects reuse `playwright/.auth/user.json` via the `setup` project. |
| Unique self-cleaning data | Every created record uses a unique name/id and cleans up after itself. |
| One tag per test | Exactly one of `@smoke`, `@sanity`, `@regression`, `@api`, `@e2e`, `@destructive` on `test(...)` — never on `describe`. |
| Revert shared mutations | Any test that changes locale, roles, flags, or settings restores them in `afterEach` / `afterAll`. |

## SHOULD

| Rule | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| Faker factories | Happy-path data via `test-data/factories/` (Faker); curated invalid sets in static `test-data/invalid/*.ts`. |
| Enums for repeated strings | Centralize repeated paths/messages; secrets and URLs from `process.env` only. |
| JSDoc on action methods | Document POM actions that navigate, submit, or mutate state. |

## WON'T

| Rule | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| XPath | No `//…` locators. |
| `waitForTimeout` | No hard-coded sleeps. |
| Hardcoded secrets | Credentials and tokens come from `process.env` only. |
| `any` | Type locators, responses, and fixtures. |
| Weakened assertions | Never drop, loosen, or reword an `expect` to go green. |
| Healing a real bug | Heal locator drift only after triage says test issue; product defects go to bug-reporter. |
| Tags on `describe` | Tags belong on individual tests. |
| `@destructive` for own data | Tests that only create/delete their own records keep an importance tag; `@destructive` is shared-state only and runs with `--workers=1`. |

## Skills & agents

**Skills** (`.cursor/skills/`): `jira-ticket-to-gherkin` (ticket→plan) · `explore-and-generate` (coverage gaps) · `exploratory-charter` (feature+risk→charter) · `pom-conventions` (POM) · `a11y-checks` (axe + keyboard) · `api-cleanup` (teardown) · `ci-failure-triage` (red-run classify) · `self-heal` (locator drift) · `jira-bug-reporter` (file bug) · `eval-report` (reliability metrics).
**Agents** (`.cursor/agents/`): `test-writer` (plan→spec) · `triage` (classify red) · `bug-reporter` (file + link Jira).
